{
  "uid": "ticket-visao-geral",
  "title": "Visao geral dos servicos",
  "description": "Os quatro sinais que dizem se a plataforma esta bem: quem esta no ar, quanto trafego passa, quanto demora e quanto falha.",
  "tags": ["ticket-platform"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Servicos no ar",
      "description": "A serie `up` e do proprio Prometheus: vale 1 quando a coleta respondeu e 0 quando falhou. E o sinal mais direto de que um container caiu.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "fora", "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                "1": { "text": "no ar", "color": "green", "index": 1 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Throughput total",
      "description": "Requisicoes por segundo somando todos os servicos.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Respostas 5xx nos ultimos 5 min",
      "description": "Erros de servidor. O 4xx fica de fora de proposito: um 404 e o sistema funcionando e respondendo que o recurso nao existe.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{outcome=\"SERVER_ERROR\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "erros"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Throughput por servico",
      "description": "Onde o trafego entra e ate onde ele desce. O gateway sempre soma mais que os demais, porque toda requisicao externa passa por ele antes de virar uma chamada interna.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por servico",
      "description": "Percentil 95, e nao media: a media esconde exatamente o caso que importa. Numa amostra em que 95 requisicoes levam 20ms e 5 levam 4s, a media fica em 220ms e parece saudavel — enquanto uma a cada vinte pessoas espera quatro segundos.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (job, le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de erro por servico",
      "description": "Proporcao de 5xx sobre o total. Em proporcao, e nao em contagem, porque dez erros em dez requisicoes e um incendio e dez erros em dez mil e ruido.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{outcome=\"SERVER_ERROR\"}[5m])) / sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tempo no ar por servico",
      "description": "Cada queda a zero e um processo que reiniciou. Util depois de uma demonstracao para separar 'o servico se defendeu' de 'o servico morreu e voltou'.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "process_uptime_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
